Pizza Data Extraction and Parsing Utility

A comprehensive utility for extracting and parsing data from structured and semi-structured files.

Features
- Supports multiple input formats (CSV, JSON, XML, HTML, SQL)
- Advanced parsing with regex and AST capabilities
- Data transformation and cleaning
- Output to multiple formats
- Command-line interface for batch processing

Usage
Run the tool from the command line:
pizza_tool --input file.txt --output parsed.json --format csv

For more help:
pizza_tool --help
